            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.11.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 11:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kwa bahati Absalomu akakutana na watumishi wa Daudi. Naye Absalomu alikuwa amepanda nyumbu wake, na yule nyumbu akapita chini ya matawi manene ya mwaloni mkubwa, hata kichwa chake kikakwama katika mwaloni huo, akanyakuliwa juu kati ya mbingu na nchi; na yule nyumbu aliyekuwa chini yake akaenda mbele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi mtu mmoja akaona hayo, akaenda akamwambia Yoabu, akasema, Tazama, mimi nalimwona Absalomu ametundikwa katika mwaloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yoabu akamwambia mtu yule aliyempasha habari, Je! Wewe umeona haya; Mbona, basi, hukumpiga hata nchi papo hapo? Nami ningalikupa fedha kumi na mshipi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mtu akamwambia Yoabu, Kama ningalipata fedha elfu mkononi mwangu, hata hivyo singalinyosha mkono wangu juu ya mwana wa mfalme; kwa maana mfalme masikioni mwetu alikuagiza wewe, na Abishai na Itai, akisema, Angalieni sana mtu awaye yote asimguse yule kijana, Absalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na tena, kama ningaliitendea roho yake kwa hila; (wala hapana neno lo lote liwezalo kufichwa mbele ya mfalme); ndipo wewe mwenyewe ungalijitenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Yoabu akasema, Siwezi kungoja na kusema nawe hivi. Akachukua vyemba vitatu mkononi mwake, akamchoma Absalomu moyoni, alipokuwa akali hai katikati ya ule mwaloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha vijana kumi, waliomchukulia Yoabu silaha zake wakamzunguka, wakampiga Absalomu, na kumwua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
